{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmh5HJJwxrTs2xKUC8ZF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**My answer:** I'd open a trading account at פסגות and buy the \"אי.בי.אי. מחקה ת\"א 125 (4A)\" fund. I'd put money in every month. I'm fairly sure. What decided it: the page puts פסגות first, marked \"★ הזול\", and says the account costs 1,049 ₪ over 10 years. At לאומי it's 4,506 ₪, and further down the list it's more than 20,000 ₪. I've heard of פסגות, so I'm fine using it. The fund is the first in its list, with \"דמי ניהול 0.1%\", and it's marked \"הבחירה\". So, first step: open a פסגות account and set up a monthly buy of that fund.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **What I looked at:**\n  - The heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד, לאורך זמן\" was exactly my question.\n  - ת\"א-125 was already picked. I left the sliders alone (10,000 and 500 a month).\n  - The big number was 86,045 ₪ \"הבחירה שלכם · הזול\".\n  - Then the two lists side by side:\n    - Accounts: פסגות on top, then לאומי, הבינלאומי, מסד, הפועלים and the rest. The cost under each name, in shekels, is what I actually compared.\n    - Funds: the אי.בי.אי. מחקה first, then תכלית, MTF and הראל, each 1,030 ₪ or more worse.\n- **What I scrolled past:** the line chart \"מה הכי משנה את מה שיישאר לכם\", the bar chart \"מתחילים מבחירה אחת…\", the big table \"עכשיו: הראל סל… ירושלים\", and the small text at the bottom.\n- **Words I didn't get:** דמי משמרת, נאמן, צוברת, \"(4A)\", \"מחזיקה את המניות\", \"מול המדד\" with \"-0.04%\", \"העמלות זו על זו\", \"לא בחישוב\". I also don't know if קרן מחקה and קרן סל are really different.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- It says \"הבחירה שלכם\" but I never picked anything. The page picked for me.\n- Further down, a chart and a table say \"עכשיו\" I'm at הראל סל at ירושלים with 79,910 ₪. That's not me. It confused me, and that's where I'd have closed the page.\n- Lots of minus signs: \"-0.04%\" on the fund I'm choosing, \"−1,030 ₪\", \"−5,485 ₪\". At first glance they look like losses.\n- Lots of banks have a grey tag \"לא בחישוב\" with \"מחיר אחר לצעירים, לחיילים משוחררים\". I'm 26, so maybe that applies to me. I didn't open those.\n- The colour bars: I guessed red means bad, but I didn't really read the legend."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5521,"cache_read_input_tokens":13868,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5521},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"057fa59c-99b0-4263-9b3c-a71ebe378e28","uuid":"ddefb6cf-bfea-471e-89eb-fa52a27c5a3d","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:41:44.733Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmh5H3S17a5hhJ8AgCGN"}
